From 6b0a30ba35d5baecfc0d0a9fdebc807d84d25d41 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Akaninyene Ekpenyong <106785283+akanejr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:38:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add interactive Today cards, Habit Details screen, shared
 timer across views

- Today habit cards are now tappable to open a dedicated Details screen
- Details includes weekly goal/progress, session counts, measured time,
  dated session history, and the same shared timer and controls
- Card and Details layouts include keyboard focus, responsive styling,
  theme support, and reduced-motion handling
- Singular/plural wording for weekly session goals and progress labels
- Updated browser test suites for new UI copy and navigation flows
- Updated Phase 1 checkpoint with verification evidence
